## Conclusion

SERVE addresses connected challenges in student food ordering and canteen management. Its current implementation provides a common platform for ordering, payment-claim verification, kitchen coordination and administrative operations.

The research discussions helped the team explore both customer and management requirements, while the Entrepreneurship Cell interaction contributed to the broader business direction of Market Intelligence.

Further field validation and documented research evidence will strengthen the problem statement and demonstrate how real-world observations influenced the final solution.
